# Compass — .gitignore
#
# Plugin source files (skills/, agents/, templates/, CLAUDE.md, README.md,
# LICENSE, hooks/, scripts/, .claude-plugin/, .codex-plugin/, .mcp.json)
# are NOT gitignored — they are part of the plugin and should be committed.
#
# The files below are user-created case data, configuration, and outputs.
# Users who want to back up their case files should use their cloud sync
# provider (Google Drive, Dropbox, iCloud) rather than a public git repo,
# since these files contain sensitive medical information.

# ── Case data (created by onboarding, contains PHI) ──────────────────────────
# Leading slash anchors these to the repo root so templates/patient/ etc.
# (which ARE plugin source and should be committed) are not matched.
/patient/
/care-team/
/config/
/documents/
/meeting-notes/

# ── User-created outputs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/reports/
/TODO.md
/considerations.md

# ── Agent runtime state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.update-state.json
.ingestion-state.json

# ── macOS system files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V8
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# ── oh-my-claudecode plugin internal state ────────────────────────────────────
.omc/

# ── Editor and IDE artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Node (for build scripts) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# ── Generated Codex subagent TOML files (build output, not source) ───────────
# Uncomment the line below if you prefer to treat these as generated artifacts.
# The default is to commit them so users who clone the repo get them immediately.
# .codex-agents/
